  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Support to IRENA 2023 &#x2013; 2027: Process consultancy for preparation and programme formulation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is to be a porcoiss consultant supporting the effective
preparation of a Danish four year (2023-2027) contribution to IRENA amounting to DKK 135
million and elaboration of the Project Document to a standard allowing it to be submitted for
approval and which addresses the key issues arising from assessments and discussions between
MFA, the Danish Ministry for Climate, Energy and Utilities, (MCEU), the IRENA and other key
stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
